OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to recruit a new
OL,4,Apolice chief?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Constabulary has struggled to
OL,7,Ffind a new chief constable after a
OL,8,Frecruitment drive ended in failure.
OL,10,FThe job was advertised in June with a
OL,11,Fsalary of #188,656 plus allowances,
OL,12,Fincluding relocation expenses, on a
OL,13,Ffive year contract.
OL,15,FInterviews took place in July.
OL,16,FSuffolk's Police and Commissioner
OL,17,F(PCC), Tim Passmore said:  "We had two
OL,18,Frounds of interviews, we advertised
OL,19,Ftwice, and unfortunately, of the four
OL,20,Fpeople who applied, nobody was quite up
OL,21,Fto the standard."
